  "description": "Get ready to rip down those trails with the Switchback 1 mountain bike by Mongoose. The Switchback was designed with everything a rider needs to take on single track trails or put in mile after mile on crushed gravel paths.\nHardtail mountain bike for rugged trail rides. Sloping top tube design provides an extra low standover for a low center of gravity for superior control on rugged terrain.\nLightweight aluminum frame features internal cable routing for a sleek look. 100 mm travel fork helps to absorb bumps in the trail.\n8-speed drivetrain with trigger shifters provides smooth gear changes.\nMechanical disc brakes deliver all-weather stopping power.\nMongoose MTB saddle keeps you comfortable, even on longer rides.",
